  "archive": {
    "visible": true,
    "entries": 5,
    "text": "RECOVERED EVIDENCE / 5 OF 14THE DESCENTREMEMBERS.01 / Intake Foundry · FOUND EVIDENCEThe Empty TruckForeman Inez counted eighteen breathing evacuees onto Truck Six. The truck left empty; the transfer ledger lists twenty-four cadavers.02 / Graft Galleries · FOUND EVIDENCENight ChartNurse Sera signed the same six patients out of Ward D three nights running. Each returned before dawn with a new pulse and no memory.03 / The Catacombs · FOUND EVIDENCESera’s RouteI followed the tagged bodies underground. They turn their heads toward the bell before it rings.04 / Resonance · FOUND EVIDENCEThe Missing SingersEvery voice on the surviving choir roster was buried in the Catacombs before the first rehearsal.05 / The Last Descent · FOUND EVIDENCEInside the GateThe warden sealed the last gate from inside. Scratched beneath the lock: “If the bells fall silent, it is because someone made it out.”",
    "width": 420
  }
